---
module: task-manager
func_id: delete-task
---

***conformance tests***

# delete-a-task
A :User: adds a :Task: named `Buy milk`, activates the delete icon of that :Task: and confirms the deletion. :TaskList: is then empty.

# keep-a-task-when-the-deletion-is-not-confirmed
A :User: adds a :Task: named `Buy milk`, activates the delete icon of that :Task: and does not confirm the deletion. :TaskList: still shows the :Task: named `Buy milk`.

***acceptance tests***
